# Copy to .env.local and fill in from your Supabase project:
# Project Settings -> API -> Project URL and anon/public key.
#
# Both are safe in the client bundle: the anon key grants nothing on its own,
# because every table is behind row-level security. The service_role key is a
# different matter and must never appear here or anywhere in this repo.
#
# Leave both unset and the app runs fully offline, exactly as it does today.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
